{
  "id": 20,
  "name": "lookahead_return_regret",
  "intent": "Added a one-step lookahead via -0.15*nearest_remaining, rewarding candidates close to their nearest unvisited neighbor. Grid topologies give uniform cluster_density and similar regret signals, so the prior terms differentiate poorly; nearest_remaining captures forward connectivity that matters in structured instances. Slightly reduced regret weight (0.20 vs 0.25) to avoid over-biasing toward high-regret picks when topology is flat. Return penalty, distance dominance, and density bonus preserved to keep clustered strength intact.",
  "tags": [
    "lookahead",
    "return_aware"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    weight = 0.20 + 0.30 * f['progress']\n    return_pen = weight * f['return_distance']\n    density = 0.05 * f['cluster_density']\n    regret = 0.20 * f['regret']\n    lookahead = 0.15 * f['nearest_remaining']\n    return -f['distance'] + return_pen + density + regret - lookahead\n",
  "source": "live_llm",
